%% Campaign stage machine as executed by LocalExecutor (services/orchestrator/src/modeler_orchestrator/local_runner.py).
%% One diagram per file (Mermaid CLI). Sequence diagrams for each workflow are in 06_WORKFLOW_ANALYSIS.md.
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED: POST /projects/{id}/campaigns (run_guard passed)
  QUEUED --> S0: daemon thread starts
  S0 --> ESCALATED: S0_not_ready (completeness, unplaceable, no expression)
  S0 --> Training: ready

  state Training {
    [*] --> Plan
    Plan --> SKIPPED: MAP plans nothing to simulate
    Plan --> Round: kind = fit
    Round --> Gate: build → simulate → [fit → re-simulate fitted CPF] → evaluate
    Gate --> VPC: PK gate passed (S1/S2)
    VPC --> Passed: coverage ≥ 80 %
    VPC --> Escalate: vpc_coverage_below_80
    Gate --> Passed: PK gate passed (S3/SM)
    Gate --> Diagnose: gate failed
    Diagnose --> Round: next permitted action (first untried)
    Diagnose --> Escalate: no permitted action / forced rule / undecidable pair
    Round --> Escalate: budget_exhausted / rounds_exhausted / stage_failed
    Passed --> NoRegression: CPF changed
    NoRegression --> JointRemedy: an earlier stage regressed
    JointRemedy --> Passed: joint fit keeps every study passing
    JointRemedy --> Escalate: regression
  }

  Training --> SJ: S1, S2, S3, [SM] done
  SJ --> S4: joint estimate kept or sequential set kept
  S4 --> ESCALATED: internal_validation_failed
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> FEEDBACK_PENDING: external_validation_failed
  S5 --> AWAITING_SIGNATURE: passed (or skipped: not achievable)
  FEEDBACK_PENDING --> AWAITING_SIGNATURE: accept_best (limitation, signed)
  FEEDBACK_PENDING --> Training: learn (MAP deviation, cycle c+1, from the stage the study trains)
  FEEDBACK_PENDING --> Training: new_evidence (measured value, cycle c+1, from S1)
  FEEDBACK_PENDING --> ABORTED: abort
  AWAITING_SIGNATURE --> S6: approve (signed, D-19 real-data check)
  AWAITING_SIGNATURE --> S7: accept_best (not offered, but accepted by the API; skips S6 and the check)
  AWAITING_SIGNATURE --> ABORTED: abort
  S6 --> S7: sensitivity · uncertainty · VBE
  S7 --> COMPLETED: reproduction passed and MAR lint clean → package.zip
  S7 --> ESCALATED: package_not_reproducible
  Training --> ESCALATED: stage escalated
  ESCALATED --> Training: retry (signed)
  ESCALATED --> NextStage: accept_best (signed; stage evidence not persisted)
  ESCALATED --> ABORTED: abort (signed)
  NextStage --> [*]
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  ABORTED --> [*]
